<!--
  Korean is the default locale, not a translation: this ships Korea-first, so the base resources
  are the ones that get the care. Voice is 해요체 throughout — an encouraging training partner,
  never a drill instructor. A missed rep is never called 실패, and effort is acknowledged before
  any correction.
-->
